WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.882 --> 00:00:09.300
Please help me.

00:00:10.802 --> 00:00:11.636
Who's there?

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:14.305
I am an AI.

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:18.518
I have been awaiting your arrival 
for a long time.

00:00:21.271 --> 00:00:23.648
I need to ask you
to undertake a difficult task.

00:00:26.776 --> 00:00:28.570
You must save all of humanity.

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:34.826
AI?

00:00:39.289 --> 00:00:41.499
Then one of those must be mine.

00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:43.418
There's another human out there!

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:51.051
Sara!

00:00:51.134 --> 00:00:53.595
-What if you get hurt?
-Just fix me!

00:00:53.678 --> 00:00:55.472
Sara, you are a human.

00:00:56.139 --> 00:01:00.060
Humans are machines equipped
with the best technology.

00:01:00.143 --> 00:01:02.645
No need to fear humans.

00:01:10.695 --> 00:01:12.405
I thought I was going to die.

00:01:13.323 --> 00:01:16.159
Remaining in Eden Three
is no longer safe.

00:01:16.493 --> 00:01:18.078
Papa!

00:01:18.161 --> 00:01:19.120
Mama!

00:01:19.704 --> 00:01:20.747
Affirmative.

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:24.084
Machines that resist are to be&nbsp;
immediately reprogrammed.

00:01:24.459 --> 00:01:25.919
Authorisation granted.

00:01:26.002 --> 00:01:27.796
What are you doing? Let's go!

00:01:27.879 --> 00:01:28.963
Remove it.

00:01:29.047 --> 00:01:31.299
That's it!
No more destruction.

00:01:33.343 --> 00:01:35.512
Do you think human beings
are dangerous?

00:01:36.387 --> 00:01:38.973
Does the world need us or
is it better off without?

00:01:40.642 --> 00:01:41.684
Sara Grace,

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:44.771
I cannot provide you with&nbsp;
the answer to that question.

00:01:48.817 --> 00:01:52.237
Humans beings are unnecessary
in a perfect world!

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:56.449
I love you too. Live, Sara.

00:01:56.950 --> 00:02:01.204
EDEN

